sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Owner
    participant B as Backend
    participant P as Bounded producer
    participant A as Assigned output
    Note over O,A: Proposed operation after a complete qualified profile exists
    O->>O: Start here: recheck, charge and bind
    O->>B: One committed operation
    B->>P: Immutable bounded request
    P->>P: Validate before connection
    loop Existing finite capture / OCR work
        P->>P: Check length and capacity before allocation
        Note right of P: Native bounds require separate evidence
        P->>P: Keep simultaneous buffers charged
    end
    alt Within every bound
        P->>A: Check before each write
        P-->>B: Bounded observation and raw outcome
        B->>B: Validate complete artifact
        B-->>O: Delivery and validation facts
        O->>O: Complete existing publication join
    else Resource or write failure
        Note over P,A: Retain original and partial objects
        P-->>B: First failure or incomplete observation
        B-->>O: Actual facts and unknowns
        O->>O: No later scenario dispatch
    end
